1
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:11,900
NEWS ANCHOR: …officials say the situation is under control.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,700
NEWS ANCHOR: Residents are urged to stay indoors…

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,000
RADIO: …evacuation points… have fallen… I repeat…

4
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,400
ETHAN: At first, I kept count. The days… the dead.

5
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,500
ETHAN: Then I stopped.

6
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:48,800
SARAH: Why are we still walking, Ethan?

7
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,600
ETHAN: Because if we stop… they win.

8
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:15,100
SARAH: How many are there?

9
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:18,300
ETHAN: Enough.

10
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:52,300
SARAH: Promise me… I won't become one of them.

11
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,200
ETHAN: …I promise.
